


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_10_9597c516:


    "又来到了屋顶。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_10_6de14b8a:



    voice "2SA_0616"
    sachiko "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_10_2f56e307:


    "只是这次的供品不是平时的香烟，而是豆子。毫不讲究地塞进嘴里，咯噔咯噔地将其咬碎。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_10_6741ce07:


    "明明可以在房间吃的。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_10_4f52c4b8:



    voice "2SA_0617"
    sachiko "「……？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_10_8b7e6d4c:


    "忽然门开了。祥子的视线转向那边。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_10_ee986e06:



    voice "2MI_0715"
    namahage_miyako "「有没有不听话的小孩啊——！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_10_55dc0420:


    "居然出现了一只生剥鬼。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_10_365a2932:



    voice "2MI_0716"
    namahage_miyako "「有没有爱哭的小孩啊——！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_10_0a8cd478:


    "生剥鬼大声地吼叫着朝这边走来。但不知是不是视线不太清楚，走得摇摇晃晃的。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_10_fae7733b:



    voice "2SA_0618"
    sachiko "「噗……」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_10_f3288193:


    "愣住的祥子拿豆子的手停在了半空中，但是看着生剥鬼一点点地靠近，又哧哧地笑了出来。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_10_c3541a56:



    voice "2MI_0717"
    namahage_miyako "「嗷呜——！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_10_2c82c5e3:


    "走到了跟前的生剥鬼举起了尖菜刀。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_10_001045dd:



    voice "2MI_0718"
    namahage_miyako "「………………」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_10_e0b579ee:



    voice "2SA_0619"
    sachiko "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_10_4ce2e195:


    "定在那里的生剥鬼。渐渐流逝的时间。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_10_7995700b:



    voice "2SA_0620"
    sachiko "「生剥鬼可不会嗷呜哦」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_10_5cf7f0d2:



    voice "2MI_0719"
    miyako "「可惜了，不怎么吓人呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_10_a3e2835d:


    "圣夜子脱下生剥鬼的面具现出真身。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_10_40512467:



    voice "2SA_0621"
    sachiko "「啊哈哈，抱歉呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_10_6283daf8:



    voice "2MI_0720"
    miyako "「又在抽烟么？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_10_bf005493:



    voice "2SA_0622"
    sachiko "「火星飞到那上面可就麻烦了，稻草可是很容易烧着的哦」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_10_534002db:


    "圣夜子赶紧将生剥鬼的装扮拿开。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_10_f703ae3d:



    voice "2SA_0623"
    sachiko "「哈哈，今天没有抽啦。在吃豆子」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_10_b15df0f6:


    "祥子把袋子给圣夜子看。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_10_15b3e795:



    voice "2MI_0721"
    miyako "「节分的？刚刚不是才吃完么，多少岁就吃多少颗的那个」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_10_8224c92f:



    voice "2SA_0624"
    sachiko "「我只是单纯的想吃而已」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_10_5cef726b:


    "说着，祥子又把豆子放进了嘴里。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_10_a_2b04714d:



    voice "2SA_0625"
    sachiko "「吃饱了」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_10_a_4ac08276:


    "把吃光了的袋子唰的一声揉成一团。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_10_a_c4efc760:



    voice "2MI_0722"
    miyako "「吃了不少呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_10_a_ef65bd34:



    voice "2SA_0626"
    sachiko "「那也只是一百岁的份吧。比起我的年龄还远远不够呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_10_a_fa8c956d:



    voice "2MI_0723"
    miyako "「那得把镇上的豆子都买回来才行」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_10_a_2e27c5cc:



    voice "2SA_0627"
    sachiko "「那也不够的。永远是不可数的」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_10_a_6cbe92b3:


    "能数得了的只有神明。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_10_a_382f8e92:


    "还有查克·诺里斯？（※注：源自“诺里斯事实”这个梗，这里可以理解为某个全知全能的人类）"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_10_a_df2873bb:



    voice "2SA_0628"
    sachiko "「如果是在地上的岁数的话，就只有五粒呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_10_a_8c2d667b:



    voice "2MI_0724"
    miyako "「那样的话我连一粒都吃不了呢。会饿的」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_10_a_3e6a7b09:



    voice "2SA_0629"
    sachiko "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_10_a_0f4a9c5b:



    voice "2MI_0725"
    miyako "「……？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_10_a_e3fc8502:



    voice "2SA_0630"
    sachiko "「你后悔舍弃了永恒么？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_10_a_c72f6f97:



    voice "2MI_0726"
    miyako "「豆子确实是很好吃，但是吃一袋也就够了哦」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_10_a_7b88e2da:



    voice "2SA_0631"
    sachiko "「不是说这个。人的寿命，运气好也只能活百年，于天使而言不过是一瞬。用永恒换来这样的寿命不觉得有些可悲么」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_10_a_9a8f82e0:



    voice "2SA_0632"
    sachiko "「即使这样，你也觉得变成人类是一件好事么？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_10_a_af58b6a1:


    "祥子静静地凝视着圣夜子。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_10_a_1dd42091:



    voice "2MI_0727"
    miyako "「好」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_10_a_b9617920:


    "她的话语，她的表情，不带一丝犹豫。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_10_a_b46d40ce:



    voice "2MI_0728"
    miyako "「是你告诉了我有这样做的价值」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_10_a_b30ab5bd:



    voice "2SA_0633"
    sachiko "「也是呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_10_a_5ed7be3e:



    voice "2MI_0729"
    miyako "「你后悔了么？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_10_a_f93ed993:



    voice "2SA_0634"
    sachiko "「……不好说呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_10_a_dcabae36:



    voice "2MI_0730"
    miyako "「…………」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_10_a_6ed4c7a3:


    "即使祥子移开了脸，圣夜子也继续凝视着她的侧脸。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_10_a_957e10ec:



    voice "2SA_0635"
    sachiko "「骗你的骗你的」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_10_a_05fc2922:


    "不知道是圣夜子的质问太强势，还是祥子不擅长被质问。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_10_a_927c5891:



    voice "2SA_0636"
    sachiko "「回去吧，别忘了带上生剥鬼」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_10_a_0ac8c9f1:



    voice "2MI_0731"
    miyako "「好」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_10_b_1d3708d1:



    voice "2SA_0637"
    sachiko "「唔……咳，咳」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_10_b_121e93e2:


    "塞得太多了，豆子好像进入了气管，祥子噎到了。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_10_b_1e72869e:



    voice "2MI_0732"
    miyako "「啊，快喝这个」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_10_b_1573f7cf:


    "圣夜子从睡衣的口袋里拿出了一罐饮料。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_10_b_f6151c30:



    voice "2SA_0638"
    sachiko "「谢……冰姜糖水？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_10_b_4d34cb94:



    voice "2MI_0733"
    miyako "「是热乎乎的罐装咖啡」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_10_b_0549391f:



    voice "2SA_0639"
    sachiko "「呼……热乎乎的咖啡真好喝啊！」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_10_b_61336d74:



    voice "2MI_0734"
    miyako "「啊哈哈，本来想着用来当暖宝宝的」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_10_b_e4d18d4f:



    voice "2SA_0640"
    sachiko "「啊，抱歉我把它喝了」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_10_b_4a713e07:



    voice "2MI_0735"
    miyako "「没有，本来就是专门为你拿的」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_10_b_6bcff72d:



    voice "2SA_0641"
    sachiko "「啊……这样啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_10_b_514c105b:



    voice "2MI_0736"
    miyako "「最近不是说身体不太好么。我就想给你拿些暖和点的东西」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_10_b_0b32362d:



    voice "2SA_0642"
    sachiko "「谢谢……抱歉让你担心了」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_10_b_559fc9f8:



    voice "2MI_0737"
    miyako "「那我就先回去了」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_10_b_1bcae643:


    "说着圣夜子就抱起了生剥鬼的装扮。"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_10_b_f1fc1a60:



    voice "2SA_0643"
    sachiko "「诶，已经要下去了么？」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_10_b_c925473b:



    voice "2MI_0738"
    miyako "「嗯，在聊太久之前」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_10_b_c0249c2b:



    voice "2SA_0644"
    sachiko "「这样啊……」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_10_b_6a6185b9:



    voice "2MI_0739"
    miyako "「不过，你也要早点回去哦。暖宝宝已经没有了呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_10_b_36a49cf8:



    voice "2SA_0645"
    sachiko "「啊……嗯」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_10_b_56ae3b8c:



    voice "2MI_0740"
    miyako "「晚安」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_10_b_54233a33:



    voice "2SA_0646"
    sachiko "「晚安」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_10_b_278c7e29:


    "………………"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_10_b_52ea1281:



    voice "2SA_0647"
    sachiko "「真是个好孩子，快要喜欢上她了呢～」"


translate simplified_chinese a09_comn_10_b_64ff81bc:



    voice "2SA_0648"
    sachiko "「……是时候了么」"
